# Fixtures deliberately carry committed credentials: a committed .env is the golden
# input for the committed-credential detector, and 27 of 100 sampled Emergent
# repositories ship one. Every value in a fixture is invented and every hostname is
# under the reserved .invalid TLD.
!fixtures/**/.env
